# Route: guide 34 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 51 to
# 53, 28 quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ironforge, Burning Steppes, Teldrassil): Ironforge -> near Ironforge
# -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Morgan's Vigil -> Dreadmaul Rock ->
# Morgan's Vigil -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Blackrock Stronghold -> Ruins of
# Thaurissan -> The Pillar of Ash -> Blackrock Mountain -> Morgan's Vigil ->
# ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Dragonkin Menace (4182; Black
# Dragonspawn 52-53, Black Drake 50-52, Black Wyrmkin 53-54).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps
# (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The
# Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
# (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential
# Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
# Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate
# of the Kingdom (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394),
# An Ancient Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms
# (96403), The Treaty of Understanding (98423), Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A
# Taste of Flame (4024), The Heart of the Mountain (4123), Marshal Windsor
# (4241), Incendius! (4263), Put Her Down (4701), Egg Freezing (4734), Egg
# Collection (4735), Doomrigger's Clasp (4764), Maxwell's Mission (5081),
# General Drakkisath's Demise (5102), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight
# Falls (1199).

